msgid ":pep:`343` - The \"with\" statement"
msgstr ":pep:`343` - Die „with“-Anweisung"

#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:800
msgid ""
"PEP written by Guido van Rossum and Nick Coghlan; implemented by Mike Bland, "
