"added to the standard library as :mod:`!xml.etree`.  The available modules "
"are :mod:`!ElementTree`, :mod:`!ElementPath`, and :mod:`!ElementInclude` "
"from ElementTree 1.2.6.    The :mod:`!cElementTree` accelerator module is "
"also included."
